Uh, open the inventory and put it in...

576
00:32:52,555 --> 00:32:54,055
あ
Ah.

577
00:32:54,055 --> 00:32:55,855
えーっと、これで…
Let's see, with this...

578
00:32:56,055 --> 00:32:59,055
麻酔が1個作れる、これで
I can make one narcotic with this.

579
00:32:59,055 --> 00:33:00,555
えーっと…
Umm...

580
00:33:00,555 --> 00:33:02,055
ほうほうほう
Ho, ho, ho.

581
00:33:02,055 --> 00:33:02,855
ナイスー
Nice.

582
00:33:02,855 --> 00:33:05,055
とりあえずみんな入れて…
Put everything in for now...

583
00:33:05,055 --> 00:33:06,055
すっきりした
Nice and clean.

584
00:33:06,055 --> 00:33:08,055
ここにある、ああ、すり鉢とか
Here are, ah, mortar and pestles.

585
00:33:08,055 --> 00:33:09,055
Sudden Narcoberries!

586
00:33:09,055 --> 00:33:10,555
ナルコベリー入れとくわ
I'll put in the Narcoberries.

587
00:33:10,555 --> 00:33:11,555
うん
Yeah.

588
00:33:11,555 --> 00:33:13,555
あと腐肉が足りないかな
Now we just need spoiled meat, maybe?

589
00:33:15,055 --> 00:33:19,055
