Oh no, are you okay?

625
00:34:40,555 --> 00:34:43,555
ビビも肉腐らせて納品しな
Bibi, rot some meat and submit it too.

626
00:34:43,555 --> 00:34:46,055
アイテム何にも持ってないです
I don't have any items on me.

627
00:34:46,055 --> 00:34:47,055
ん？
Hm?

628
00:34:47,055 --> 00:34:49,055
いや、帰ってきたら肉あるから
No, there's meat here once you get back.

629
00:34:49,055 --> 00:34:50,255
はい、帰ります
Okay, I'm heading back.

630
00:34:50,255 --> 00:34:52,555
あの、集会場行こうかな？集会場おいで
Um, maybe go to the gathering area? Come to the gathering area.

631
00:34:52,555 --> 00:34:53,855
はい、集会場
Yes, gathering area.

632
00:34:53,855 --> 00:34:54,855
ああ、お腹空いた
Ah, I'm hungry.

633
00:34:54,855 --> 00:34:56,055
入るか、一回
Should I go inside for a bit?

634
00:34:56,055 --> 00:34:57,555
こっちとか？
Over here?

635
00:34:57,555 --> 00:34:59,855
ちょっと待って、この中にね…
Wait a sec, inside here...

636
